# Local-only GitHub OAuth app credentials. OBVIOUS FAKES — the real values are
# production secrets (`wrangler secret put GITHUB_CLIENT_ID` /
# `GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET`) and never appear in this repo.
#
# Nothing local ever reaches github.com with these: `wrangler dev` can complete
# the flow only against a real OAuth app, and the tests stub the two upstream
# calls. They exist so the Worker has something to send and the generated types
# know these bindings are strings.
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=Iv1.0000000000000000
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=not-a-real-secret-0000000000000000000000
